AB  - ; HANGZHOU, China, July 5, 2022 /PRNewswire/ -- Hikvision has begun working with environmental protection partners to provide intelligent video technologies to help protect pangolins, ancient creatures that appeared in fossil records possibly going as far back as 35-55 million years. Deforestation and intrusive human activities have disrupted their forest ecosystems extensively, leaving pangolins vulnerable to illegal hunting and other dangers. In light of these challenges, Hikvision has taken actions to help protect these renowned and precious guardians of the forest. [ABSTRACT FROM PUBLISHER]
