AU  - Van der Walt, T.
AU  - Anon
T2  - Wild & jag = Game & hunt
AB  - Briefly comments on the illegal practices occuring on a Bushveld game farm when the owner is absent most of the time. States this neighbour, farming in absentia, had been previously warned about the illegal hunting at night and visitors carrying off loads of firewood in the early hours of the day, however his supervisor gave the explanation that wild dogs, not seen in years, were the cause of the game shortage. Points out that Black Economic Empowerment, transformation and land reform occur liberally on the neighbouring farm, but without the knowledge of the owner. Refers to the venision recipe of a stuffed eland filet, prepared by the caterers of Otterskloof Private Nature Reserve near Philippolis, next to the Vanderkloof Dam. Points out that this reserve is in the jewel area of the Southern Free State hunting region. Mentions the ingredients of the stuffing that includes pieces of salami, feta cheese, garlic, parsley and mustard and also the marinade of olive oil, rosemary and red wine. Explains the method of stuffing the eland meat undercut, marinating the filet for two days in a fridge and then browning the meat on all sides in a pot over the coals. Provides contact details for more information
