AU  - Anon, A
T2  - Birdwatch Magazine
AB  - BIRDS Abstract: Birdfair has revealed that this year's fundraising project will be protecting migratory birds in the eastern Mediterranean, in parallel with 2015's Champions of the Flyway theme. Last year's Birdfair was a resounding success despite businesses continuing to feel the pinch of the recession, and crucial funds were raised for BirdLife International’s Saving the World’s Seas and Oceans Programme. The total amount raised for this will be announced on 6 February, but in the meantime the organisers have revealed that the Project for 2015 will be to protect migratory birds in the eastern Mediterranean
