TY  - JOUR
TI  - Dooierus: Die Bekendste plaas in die land
AU  - Jonker, H.
T2  - Wild & jag = Game & hunt
AB  - States all over South Africa game farms can be found, such as the Limpopo Province, North West Province, Northern, Eastern and Western Cape, Free State and KwaZulu-Natal. Points out that most game farms are familiar to hunters as they remember each hunting experience. Comments however that nobody seems to know the most widely known farm, the so-called `Langplaas' and who are the culprits hunting there. Explains every landowner whose farm borders on a road, can relate a story of game mortality, wounded animals and unknown tracks over the fences. Emphasises that small wild animals grazing on veld next to the road on the road reserves are providing joy and a glimpse of nature to the passers-by. Regrets that drunken, callous drivers could find pleasure in shooting at these animals, or running over them, as this unethical and illegal game poaching, hunting and animal abuse cannot be justified. Urges the hunting communtity not to hunt on `Langplaas', since it is game reserve which man an animal can appreciate
