TY  - JOUR
TI  - Technische hulpmiddelen en doelwitselectie bij woninginbraak; Een experimenteel onderzoek naar het gebruik van Google Maps en Google Street View
AU  - Van Daele, Stijn
AU  - Peeters, Marlijn
AU  - Vandeviver, Christophe
AU  - Ledure, Efien
AU  - Vander Beken, Tom
T2  - Tijdschrift voor Criminologie
AB  - Technological evolutions and burglary target selection: a study on the use of Google Maps and Google Street ViewTechnological progress has a great impact on the lives of many citizens. The increasing amount of available information may however be used by criminals too, for example by burglars in their search for a suitable target. Applying the rational choice perspective and by means of an experiment with students, this paper first investigates whether it is likely or not that tools such as Google Maps and Google Street View are used for burglary. Furthermore, we investigate whether the considered target characteristics differ when such tools are used. The results indicate that we cannot give an affirmative answer to these questions so far.
